      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This would make group projects sooo much easier. right now having one person upload the world and manage everything just causes issues, especially when it comes to splitting money or credit. roblox has had this forever and it works great. Would be cool to see something like this in vrchat so creators can actually team up without dealing with a bunch of drama or awkward talks about money and ownership of the world.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
