  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Roblox has a feature where you can publish a game from a group instead of an individual, and alongside this has built-in revenue sharing that makes it easier for multiple people to work on a single project without there being any drama or headaches. I think VRChat would heavily benefit from a feature like this. It would add more reasons for groups to exist and encourage talented creators to work together on worlds, which would improve the quality of said worlds.",
